  "title": "<strong>Attorneys with Swag Delivers A Vibrant Single Track, \"NRG\" </strong>",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Attorneys with Swag</strong>, a dynamic USA-based rap duo, just dropped their hot new single \"<strong>NRG</strong>.\" The punky trap-styled banger is guaranteed to get you pumped!&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4BgTb4YQmTKo9XlesuuuYy\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/4BgTb4YQmTKo9XlesuuuYy\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With infectious beats, skilfully crafted flows, and a huge hook, \"<strong>NRG</strong>\" has something for any hip-hop fan. Check it out now and ride the wave of <strong>Attorneys</strong> <strong>with Swag</strong>'s exciting sound!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>CLICK HERE TO STREAM: <strong>Attorneys with Swag's </strong>\"<a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/track/4BgTb4YQmTKo9XlesuuuYy\">NRG</a>.\" on Spotify</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>CONNECT WITH <strong>Attorneys with Swag:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/attorneyswithswag\">Instagram</a> | <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/7E6Wvzpyi7iKpEheoOMDkJ\">Spotify</a> | <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/attorneyswithswag\">Facebook</a> | <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@attorneyswithswag\">Tik Tok</a> | <a href=\"https://twitter.com/AttorneysWSwag\">Twitter</a> | <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/AttorneysWithSwagTV\">YouTube</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
